# BuildKit looks for "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile
# before falling back to .dockerignore in the context root. Because the build
# context is the repository root (so the Dockerfile can COPY app/), a plain
# docker/.dockerignore would be silently ignored. See README.
#
# Allowlist: exclude everything, then let in only what the build needs.
*
!app/
app/**/*_test.go
app/**/*.md
